{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_05",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8acb6236973032f28f8aa1057958f2eeb58e3dbb1584feecf1dbc9e65243f01e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c67e11954dfa74ae7e384b569daf374c71a3547aa7361a22f14f81bfd92f788",
      "text": "三位一体冲锋！！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08eec17d80722dace64c87919dd3e42690e839bcff2dc54027ee5912c5dd083b",
      "text": "多亏了前阵子Legenders出演的直播节目，\n315 Production开始步入正轨。\n在此期间，THE 虎牙道也接到了活动的邀请。\n看中了3位前格斗家履历的主办方，其真面目究竟是？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4fe9663b1c30cef05a726883179c94adc263067b1d6df8b2aef98e90574c49",
      "text": "第5话",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c67e11954dfa74ae7e384b569daf374c71a3547aa7361a22f14f81bfd92f788",
      "text": "三位一体冲锋！！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:173d39fa80ae2618cc1f412e66a1c4809e8c2e285fa9095c9e8ec01dfd21ca9b",
      "text": "给我们的，活动邀请？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a690d93d372f64d38711f1723adaa7bc39780006402bf2ccda4d4162449a8cb",
      "text": "难道说，是多亏了前阵子Legenders出演的\n那个大扫除节目吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3e51085ece37be374e3cc3b2496ad19ec75dbf76d798ea60d3d57311e048b4",
      "text": "自从那之后，总觉得315 Pro的知名度\n在蹭蹭往上涨呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:613e60684715835dafbd218b99e12f0600ae5db3f6fcff92124288b625fb7db2",
      "text": "管他什么节目不节目的，找上本大爷那是\n理所当然的吧！倒不如说，来得太慢了啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67f2157aa52b82093cb09952d8c5e43fcbf6af044ee0f0d8a4b10583d83f9915",
      "text": "（出演活动……如果顺利的话，\n说不定也会映入弟弟和妹妹的眼帘）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90fb6b101005d31d70b96ec4703f79add2fa8f0fab4dc78bad53cd7c77a48cd3",
      "text": "……参加吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d097f219d7aa7c81610aa1349b674459226e5fbf68f62e9b30d21048b146ec43",
      "text": "好嘞！无论是什么工作我都全力接下，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfe548e8552d8a0adbb19eff06c5375de4bae008242f55d001f969d7ca27ba2c",
      "text": "然后呢？对方怎么说的。\n可别是什么无聊的工作啊？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a2e31ffa1d349bd17619aae0d6ea677fed7203b21b5263a5d7cd72d91e36771",
      "text": "这次的工作，是看中了各位作为格斗家的履历\n才发来的邀请……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b1d4f1f54fa4527f4cf5f4bb75136c631d9cf349667f8b0f0ba3cbcbdf3d5c5",
      "text": "是名为《Victory Rush!》的\n格斗技活动的开场表演。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a94ecd8bba06892e25b9f5a5f36456d4d5d2ad5f033858b81b42d2ac85fc08",
      "text": "那么，就是能把强大的家伙痛扁一顿咯。\n这不是挺有意思的嘛！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea97b4514829ad5f099c796c192b472ece2b60307a19fb33975b2a5f09f7ed5",
      "text": "哈哈，不对啦，涟。\n是要在大家面前做表演啦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10a34feaf8bd5aae0137e33ba8974ead3639b539bdddd5e37c1f6eef3114db34",
      "text": "是的。各位这次的工作，\n不是去格斗而是进行Live表演。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29940c33236768c851542a6532acdfa84cbd462c809119419dbd1682884584a9",
      "text": "我想，这份工作对我们而言\n一定会非常重要！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ab4dddf892326dd497a90500ec71beef7ef581152a6b56aabaa07180320a1d",
      "text": "这是什么意思？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ef23346eb7e57ba9656d4bc0a5f2836b509eac992017b36b25a50ef483e1118",
      "text": "《Victory Rush!》的主办方，正是我们\n以参赛为目标的JIF的赞助商之一。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9cec51794c878e3060def5ffb427f9b668465e4466f45e652936699ea75d7eb",
      "text": "这么说……只要好好表现，\n就可能获得通往JIF的推荐吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56bf513855622271c939ec3b9d4716d9cd69d692fca99ccaf55849ebf37e97b2",
      "text": "是的！所以，我们一定要让它成功！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f44527829783341b87cb050b475bd3b7299fc1066461e9bfbb6c5814788099ea",
      "text": "Victory Rush! 当天……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5354b0cb97e0fa02ed35f1daada223c24477d69db6b07fc6506c2f33db1cdf6",
      "text": "下起暴雨来了呢……\n早上明明还是那样的大晴天。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4faaa726acb4723e37f00f69545c3e992234e2b61a6789fc73d331de4a71226",
      "text": "主办方那边也正式发来联络了。\n今天的活动确定中止。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb258fa3ce4ca9122fc1239860c4e08d7423ed76c370055a9d71b6d072c6bfd3",
      "text": "……我们的舞台也取消了吗。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea45f130e9a85a13e63fdae7487da97cc6c7634da1424fd5dfb9bdd6a7b117f9",
      "text": "毕竟不能让观众置身于危险之中嘛。\n这也是无可奈何的事。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:039311fb64afaf461865693ddc16a2a4a1bbce2e5a635e4050415db4485f2dbc",
      "text": "啧……喂小不点！\n别摆出一张扫兴的脸啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae369180ff3f050500f159baa189f870d4ebd6d097f528a7b920d5d24fb4185f",
      "text": "该不会是在哭吧？\n库哈哈！太逊了。真是杂鱼啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:099c51e8213b3ab23b680b4d6c08c502de22a4485a052623d364d2e0fbea88f8",
      "text": "……我又没沮丧。\n跟你不一样。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d535840cdebf83508bcc0d2df7d8913e8e25636229fcae1d4783bebcef2c7f31",
      "text": "哈啊？本大爷怎么可能会失落。\n你眼睛长哪去了啊大笨蛋！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0c469c2520223c317dd4baef4de441e60f882cb979e1ae961145543e19a9b9",
      "text": "好了好了你们两个，快别吵了！\n虽说能理解你们的不甘心，但就算吵架也……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a29f0e537d0315341701a072142e0b8b71966f1897dca261ca96500565323887",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！\n果然如传闻所言，是一群精力充沛的年轻人啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a9f974a144226d8b3229ec43a044da0b4e5030f2939969e583310a32bc8035",
      "text": "啥啊，这大叔……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9742afee9ef3a12e67c702aa6379d219d43c5a226223814724dab9b3e02a0075",
      "text": "……这股气魄，看起来绝非泛泛之辈。\n到底是什么人？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9119cf140b65522354ca042be6386dc596c31160339f5067457c63fc8d92d84",
      "text": "您、您是……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba45f493ca34fc23e86e53578956b6f7e17cca470f79825909d6b14c565effaa",
      "text": "没想到这次的邀请，竟然来自那位传说中的\n综合格斗家雷皇，真是太吃惊了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0811bb554ff0cb5925a6df6cf6718bcfecb9da3772df542978c5b1dd6eea58",
      "text": "我现在为了振兴格斗界，\n正在运营着各种各样的项目。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bcc8118e9ff0ffde60188614a50b8e7550379bc7b319ef43bfc5300b94bd168",
      "text": "今天的活动也是其中的一环。我觉得让前格斗家\n出身的偶像登场，正是最合适不过的了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4063a465e18f1757984fb01095a173ffbd797fc706094178e611bc399a36bbf",
      "text": "但不是已经取消了嘛。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31d12463303ea095348ddc57d589c94a2aba44553f33cd07a3c57ad5dc43d5e4",
      "text": "我深感遗憾。希望能以某种形式，\n对这次的事做出弥补……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2db786c0dcfcb11f333837bd39338b1940a264dc88843c79ec4bae28adc3ae",
      "text": "那就，把我们推荐去JIF吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6705e2f62bb14394bbe36ffcda17c6f918b9581ac7d5e5b61df1755838fa759",
      "text": "武……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f692917c7cb989d98886647c85f2cbc38bdc1530cf8bc9c38709d9a8a80679dd",
      "text": "……我想出战JIF。\n为此，我做好了不惜一切代价的觉悟。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a1e1899e17b91d5414e6d390fa4485924c56830ba0403bd833e4d7f190814d4",
      "text": "……是啊。虽然活动取消了，\n但能像这样直接见到赞助商。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b6ec6b4e031131e4382dd1b692767ba89fbc0973008c2d8c8b7be77f3579a81",
      "text": "雷皇先生，作为赞助商，\n请把我们推荐去JIF吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18953d04ccefd11df329a96d60208eb4eda6c2216caef327e5d5c59ed24935e8",
      "text": "我也恳请您！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d57be90df7a9a5e9b7e8b5a4d733cd0bae9409a91f062f1dd54754c4de0968b2",
      "text": "…………哈哈哈哈！\n果然，不耍花招的直拳最能打动人心啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b479820e29ce32b0fdb23ed533e63418492e95e535ee0deb0c2e8c53e50c39f",
      "text": "JIF的推荐吗，没问题。\n不过，有个条件。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000105:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000112:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6973a2e9e4077a2bd7def1fcb770b2012a9da90d1e544b289b051f79e1a65ba7",
      "text": "喂喂？\n●●●●プロデューサー酱？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000114:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cb99d607abeac290889756e20355494720920575029770135a8b1767b75fd82",
      "text": "听说你要和THE 虎牙道的孩子们一起去山里特训？\n人家太担心了，忍不住就打过来了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000116:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000117:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49462df6eac21cf4c7c9f2890dd333de32c287722960720259cdf562272ed40a",
      "text": "您是在担心我们呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000119:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209b954fb52d4d2294c2f240262a0338e58fced3a27e3ba29e9acbd1fe85db75",
      "text": "呵呵。\n那么，你有好好做好防护措施吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9657ee19da6e6702b20f8e1471430cb6303c933441d2866143f2b2203c4818e",
      "text": "那是当然的吧？\n为了进山，你有好好做好防护措施吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000126:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac333ca4b6eda6dc7db70058f2a55831740e5087d789dfdcc2a264f499f41350",
      "text": "听好哦？蚊虫叮咬和晒伤可是肌肤的大敌呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000128:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01cf46619f6110006df5410444430e82b6065a6d923e255faecdb89846a53dd0",
      "text": "偶像自然不必说，\n制作人酱也必须多加小心才行。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d940c214d031be5bfdea2b7da344714e4a55a4a1ecd980ca6481a0bc92409839",
      "text": "防晒霜和驱蚊喷雾，\n一定要带去哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_c:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae1c1c6d3cb6518907276f57d3784840e60353da647554bc512e162c72575e2",
      "text": "那么先这样啦。\n下次，记得把旅行趣闻讲给人家听哦♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23e2fdaf00c9db322c14362bd744c479db11d70717aeb41d80d47bc3d5f6b38",
      "text": "……真的没问题吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc2f1be903d68896cd7ceeae0cff0f0c1862a8ee83a5090e756f127a56f4ef0d",
      "text": "啊，你是说这些行李吗？大部分都是换洗衣物和\n毛巾，没有看上去那么重的啦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b2a303b940d1b0a587bf70c2a4907b137a5cdee544dba9af2858d98a2f4f124",
      "text": "行李也是一方面，但突然说要去深山里什么的。\n我很担心啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3f6c8e015b199e2f77c50191dec972962d7ab7c65ccfef342f4915f903ca14b",
      "text": "总结一下●●●●プロデューサー的说法，\n雷皇提出的JIF推荐条件，只有一个……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4708fbecc0bc431a0795137bd79a94832acf38550ab6e1a5826857030071989a",
      "text": "在下次格斗技活动的表演赛上，\nTHE 虎牙道要战胜雷皇，对吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:450c5422e0496458a081ae7e856b1acbdaddd68f084054c104cf5a95ca9b7c44",
      "text": "那么为什么要去深山闭关呢……\n我完全无法理解。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c03f54378d3f2b967aa7a4399846546766f599ebc4fde2a907409dfe8b095b5a",
      "text": "会吗？\n说到为了变强而特训的场所，当然就是深山了吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a89bd8814957d579c9c03c847f3bd3011a152878909332f4e0003053088adbd6",
      "text": "深山闭关啊。感觉有点好玩呢。\n对了，我带慰问品过去吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e8bed9d41dca08e28fde6c677f726896bf48606b70f7a3409e95ae32c93210",
      "text": "真是一群无忧无虑的家伙。\n喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88902a585f354ae4e86d43d783a68284b9fff8f003090ce11f13d36ce8e8b511",
      "text": "务必带上用于消毒的干净水源和消毒液。\n山溪里的水看似清澈，其实细菌很多的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6feae207868a4b0064f7cc1f7808738790b22ec0c85711dd21b4e5edd3cd0b8f",
      "text": "山里的天气也很不稳定呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:518c2e00d76282ac76742e040a4855f63f45e732fa32b68b2d2142428f911791",
      "text": "如果卷积云或高层云开始遮蔽太阳，\n就说明低气压正在接近，请一定要多加小心。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bdb915d8982223d4b5367d4ffd1addf903f2250f346a68136cc3de343613dcb",
      "text": "（和说着“区区一座山总会有办法的（啦！）”的\nTHE 虎牙道各位相比，这温差也太明显了……！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0181a1565989ba7785a94d6e8c2aedd95c9c4073c64d03b9bab2770c8af6885",
      "text": "两位，谢谢你们的建议！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d3a941b28cfa10f3727a1ab2b98327a3f73219bfd56c7493b090455b376480",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父——！\n差不多该出发了哦——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6ce178e5e333d0298a5525cb4bcd2084429a9bb97969cad209299a1a823cc25",
      "text": "不在期间的工作，就放心地交给我吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba828eb7ed13cd16fc7f93c9adadc5d32c8f2ee8d713a68975dec1df18bc3611",
      "text": "好的，拜托你了。\n那么，我们出发了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000170:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f1446c096c4b35d62c51a042d69d84195bf1363961205c5d141f108bae4bf8",
      "text": "辛苦了，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e718729a730c2ef951358d57507f3d2f937e58018d0b579adf53c7eb99455fa",
      "text": "我听说了哦。听说下次THE 虎牙道要\n通过格斗技去和JIF赞助商对决……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000174:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbc3b5d3fea6182da8d7c2bda64750df992ce14f2802e2e958393ad4ac26c878",
      "text": "想必会很辛苦，但请加油。\n我也会为你们加油的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000176:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01eebb368b41424a6a3e71f2f4ea1bec6ace39ff7b160a261ae5ecafa7b18abe",
      "text": "说起来，听说为了比赛还要去合宿对吧？\n什么时候我们也想尝试一次呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000178:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9181b20b7cf7a990a2af8fe262c24b0d41a38765949f535ab9f0ee38860d4e79",
      "text": "是山地合宿吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000179:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bf5a64ef60d541d3a174f4903fd7c7f55a9456cac1855dff279db66d8acb3b",
      "text": "是海边合宿吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a25a084adfe8d480011cb05ca128b71945786f72f88407b71954720800e9bfb3",
      "text": "虽然山里也很有吸引力，\n但我果然还是更喜欢大海呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4241edf85bd916c0ee0b53024583ace2cf98ec28cc9e238b611717a591c970b9",
      "text": "不愧是制作人。\n没错，就是海边合宿！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cc10237a0afaf1a3c231fe5ff6eb658d85382461134fbf84583015098272cd",
      "text": "白天进行潜水或出海钓鱼，晚上则伴着\n新鲜的鱼类料理共同畅谈……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_d:cmd-000190:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b69c7a18202c931e01439a034ba04e9932cb1d623e1ff1830f6553410ecae654",
      "text": "到那个时候请制作人务必也一起参加。\n那么，我就先告辞了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1576e5ccb5cd84456e81dc30c11cc56e2fd8d852b4ccdf05ef421492a0d047e2",
      "text": "特训地点的山中",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efd91cd829f6ef13b1cea42d2e2fc320364d22af1af56a0f6a0ba1f0ecbe3f4a",
      "text": "雷皇的实力吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3d203a78d624b210abcf42e687015228a691de41a5753cb9b76985b3d5946e",
      "text": "……恐怕，以现在的我们是赢不了的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1447a12e0c8d11e991a6b71416b6c6052eb012c2d94e24f1288f13fead80fc4",
      "text": "是那么难对付的对手啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b9a022f3f58667c720046ee5d974ec55cd2e66ec1da2866efa421902d674d5",
      "text": "是的。提起雷皇，在他现役时期可是所向披靡。\n听说哪怕是退居二线的现在，其实力也依然健在。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6c0f8df2bf0a205575e45fe0cd514dd80c0655f130241d4e248c85c732391ff",
      "text": "实际上，只要亲眼见识到那股气魄……\n就算是现役时期的我，也不知道能不能赢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5dc981ec3e489e7f9fe15eb9a973a4568dc7bce4dd9e52d6c8bf0822d93dc36",
      "text": "但是，现在的我们可是有三个人！\n在经过锻炼之后，只要能好好配合，胜算也……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa89a1191ae283c937656c350fb80df8156e60e1399f2497e19b0762efd6174f",
      "text": "哈啊……哈啊……圆城寺先生！\n如果手头空出来了，能来当我实战对练的对手吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d371673eac6e704fb2288f362cf7e75f075924543d5af63330a8c974f602d2e6",
      "text": "武那家伙，长跑好像跑完了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d12bcd7b61aea970549bfe49ce0c8acec8c74d391527e02ee589faf54705766e",
      "text": "真是的……明明三个人一起来合宿，\n武和涟却都不肯一起特训。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:260568a8eec73d339b80a25d3787a21ba7139d48b31b38426dd398bf444e4b7d",
      "text": "要是能想办法齐心协力就好了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2d04f631cd9ae477dda07292acab8c5ebcedc61e89d9213813ab5324aefa6eb",
      "text": "总之，武在叫我了。\n我去给他当对手啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81fcecf75e06ee750fbb00af7df7acd7a3430c8fdae652fa7dcbcbd2ac5257ac",
      "text": "（……不一起特训，吗。\n但是，获胜的关键应该在于三个人的配合才对）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29edde48f6133ccfbf0fdd9605d5cb617ceacd884984289de26a08a6f4394e8d",
      "text": "三个人的配合……\n为此，我自己能做到的事情是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f1212223b4f8fd727be08e61d3fd257da4af4a9005851b3b06c1c7cb182478",
      "text": "哟，●●●●プロデューサー！\n特训进展如何啊？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66524b8ce41eece0a16c3901b2b050ea46c4e3e03b0a0955411313fbd56acfe7",
      "text": "辉先生！还有翼先生和薰先生也是！\n你们特意赶过来了啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc5d12b59218528d9658ba7610ac47b057eebec4735bbc3e269b590990f8a460",
      "text": "这个是慰问品！\n如果可以的话，请大家一起吃吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0139e45e76bcfb7155dc65783f19551dd68060c6bdccf40d1c6e8cddc47babc",
      "text": "哦哦，看起来很好吃的饭团啊！\n而且，还带了这么多。太感谢了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbd13cbea8a18cafc28290b3855d2b47f7e9cd8921b13b0536166f58f5dd7568",
      "text": "……那么，情况如何？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bda7de40ec23045f2850ad7180e42738c450b096de3d8f2d9ed078e8a417414",
      "text": "实际上，武先生和涟先生的配合不太顺利。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba3a41a15f5f23584f6f48fd188aae61686852540d207be0106117ceaef293cb",
      "text": "现在，也还在各自不同的地方训练中。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afce993daea34b21bb42dda4914ab6b0a63ceb0f0926ee9f206f133f2c304e2a",
      "text": "原来如此……嘛，要和合不来的人\n齐心协力确实很难啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58764dc16d3e6a9342aba3ebdec970f7d56335c0c048247bc202fca72624ba92",
      "text": "我们这边也有个动不动就找茬呛人的家伙在，\n我很能理解那种辛苦啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063e48a6f96ef08364a1fb962a12dd4424d531054744cb0af7aac3f5c4c2743a",
      "text": "……那两个人可才十几岁啊。\n别把他们和我们混为一谈。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dd66869e214c747ea9b446fadbc1579746d7f46648489935bee64976c682e18",
      "text": "好了好了。那么，●●●●プロデューサー有\n什么对策吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34ee60910c5e216e1457fe1520e20edef8e5dc2f332df0ffaf57aa027ec0a778",
      "text": "没有三人的配合，\n是赢不了雷皇的啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_f:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f10104ca449f7e0d719fecf7df67721224b087bbf35b5b2567bd0d0be4bda8",
      "text": "嗯。我和道流先生也是这么想的，\n打算先安排一次大家开诚布公沟通的机会，可是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29dceaa123cd96bde48dcaf4581244657ab4dffcc296ee0b86e3a3c20a3add9b",
      "text": "为了配合而商量沟通，吗……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4d362e75d3ea36bc5fc0c5f586cdb9e308e6d128b9fb08859c955bfbcca3c3",
      "text": "我也去叫了涟先生，但他说了句“麻烦死了”\n就不知道跑去哪里了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b311acbe82ce76776cf1191150e146bcb8f2933e0e037b44355163ef444f83",
      "text": "那家伙……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb249515f28ac65af8181285c29ce527e1403ca2bdb0f5a566bc736242fcf5c",
      "text": "武先生，很讨厌和涟先生并肩作战吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18db66af885dd181e64ca888616908db226b01f74ade81a948423019940a9ec2",
      "text": "谈不上讨不讨厌。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb29bdf6ee4da979bc2f262eedb4a198629aff0e0a17d6120ce9bed461240d13",
      "text": "是那家伙动不动就找茬呛人不好。\n只要没有那个……倒也没什么问题。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f22245af8aa3a6076a76bb80d54c27b95b2d17671f1be23d41b28ad71f72e1fc",
      "text": "武先生的这番想法，我去传达给涟先生吧。\n请稍等片刻，我去找他！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d3609f02df66097e07935727a2d124b923adf5f50792ce2168ac78acfae8bd9",
      "text": "……所以，你才在山里到处乱逛啊。\n本大爷怎么可能和小不点商量沟通啊，大笨蛋。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b07ac2d2d9c5f5cf756bbb4e48cfdb785457a1b62a7c8a61d235f390abcfda2",
      "text": "和武先生并肩作战，就那么讨厌吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f7d82885e526774b5c0c5bf1645d3e504184f0996bcebb69c923ba208d617d",
      "text": "讨厌得很。本大爷可是要打倒那家伙\n成为最强的人。怎么可能跟他合作。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40155fe9e8b0b3f4b27b2b13986ff75d0918966c287fab5831c8e56dede06bd",
      "text": "要是不战胜雷皇，就无法自称最强了吧。\n所以现在，有必要作为THE 虎牙道齐心协力……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e93b2e6a04475c5a3cfd3571025569b5eec081cd3ebd996dbdfae98b34cba94",
      "text": "啧……啰啰嗦嗦烦死人了。\n总之，话谈完了！走开啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae30d4945e923fab041a8fad504c73b21801f8f040cbba182765576c5718d22",
      "text": "哇！突然这么大声，\n吓了我一跳……等等，哇哇，哇……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:769790fc77580a05292d22a128060d9ed7cdc490984ece3ce1c9bbc270e59bd0",
      "text": "喂！你这家伙！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c3be65403954048fe9d99663bb45306a62d253c7ffbf419e1e1644a9c22dbf",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，到底去哪了……\n从那时候起应该已经过了一个小时了……嗯？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_g:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c2c3d1ef595abd8e279284601ccf8d9e584984eb48b3efe3bbbe66ac8dfe505",
      "text": "涟？怎么了，站在那种悬崖边上……\n等等，●●●●●●●●●●师父！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2e93b216943cb668f7ae009fa8e4e1c9687ff135eefc0a31bcf859106b6758c",
      "text": "我也来帮忙。\n一起把制作人拉上来。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b340fd3553aef76b73944df3c8383995fa015a9482802517fec2a3416ac82ad",
      "text": "啊啊！？谁要借你的力啊……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d25112b9dbbc72d030a60829af1888d001f500bf4dbf2f48ca478ec5dfa8ac1",
      "text": "现在是说这种话的时候吗！\n听口令一起拉！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13898139d7dbc0cc8ebdf8086ec215357d0a3957b1e267a6b0748507787e086",
      "text": "一二！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d5154b999ca64bf792f805e8ea603b629ec86737b89092c679f2614eb94ec00",
      "text": "哎呀，真是太危险了。\n不过……嗯，看来没有受伤比什么都强！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bd76f7808364c237a6744e7fb5db2ce97097de8b7898332233aadbb731c5997",
      "text": "嗯？这个悬崖……高度还不到两米吧。\n虽然被灌木丛挡住不太好辨认，但立刻就能踩到地面。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf63ff360a4e24525aa7c66381757b6baf5388efd42eae4f2ffce0b665c31e57",
      "text": "对、对不起。因为事情发生得太突然，\n好像有点慌了神。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b9b1af727ea6383ca85b5f480a352e77f78ed8ce64115c7a6dd17f613af1c1",
      "text": "啊，真的呢。只要稍微把脚伸长一点，\n就能踩到地面的那种小矮崖呢。啊哈哈……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f82434d391adc7d27dc638fa57a5a77662fd8016b3b755b3cd9ac5ea650a539f",
      "text": "简直是让人空忙一场。你这个慢吞吞的家伙！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd071c16e2b4e3bb2b7d803f2081e3a1866ea639f03638114a580d1e1828f39",
      "text": "喂。制作人可是为了你，\n才特意跑到这种深山里来的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8324a8fc8cb259e5ee9da6ac9385a6d2031a5b0526acea362af4b31a5054bd49",
      "text": "没错。正如武所说。\n涟，你难道没有什么想对师父说的吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a097f2b0c67b5bf73be28d3a8a0ca156483814d3dd31f4fc97c64694ae72765b",
      "text": "……还不是因为像你这么弱的家伙擅自到处乱晃，\n才会变成那样的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d19691ec893fb96a32a5172b47bb3f73b36373b2a674eca20002fcf5059a62a5",
      "text": "对不起，●●●●●●●●●●师父。\n涟这孩子就是不坦率……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c917d0341d14698c76dc6010ea4a858adf9974ca68d56ab72371fe0cfbe95a30",
      "text": "没事……比起那个，我现在正因为\n大家齐心协力而感到高兴呢……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7073b88a83e5ff844dc174c4fb5f43a398ab5a5fae568b72a6b7954c3c50ddb",
      "text": "哈啊？你这家伙……在说什么胡话呢，大笨蛋！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11abab1ad66a834170c93b1771d7ec40b5c8fc5b7b845b6297b953c6be7e21c9",
      "text": "可恶，浪费了多余的体力……\n喂，慢吞吞的下仆！赶紧回去开饭啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000207:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:310365a03f0546604eafcdadfca7cda45fcfc919eefc51d1b4cb83c771f32892",
      "text": "明天终于要和雷皇决战了！\n你们两个状态怎么样？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6dc5c51b2fa77e4f067b5b2601ed2753e25de24d28e8ebde06cf0b33c24237f",
      "text": "多亏了合宿动作的利落感找回来了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000219:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30f92d0f8337c0d3e889501b8ecf110d20025a4bb9aaed731de963822a2152b8",
      "text": "身体状态也万无一失",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000221:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14158c783aa6f3bba50484d9608eac4bd4a3d1e425c42b5bf528350b30a43f56",
      "text": "本大爷",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000223:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac4fd6d595148c9ffeef78876039252a4c19d976b99785c6dbeda3ac2407cce",
      "text": "怎么可能会输给那种老头子",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000225:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:287232647fcbc283a9969628696643804a7b1e2e9158dccb7d47f2571d6fa84f",
      "text": "大家真是太可靠了。\n当然，我也调整得非常完美",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000227:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c2140f547475f7b75f172abb8705816600b3f83c324e8563d61bd8f0683f09",
      "text": "师父，明天的比赛我们\n会拼尽全力的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000229:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7019f13e29b67103086599142be1bc25fe5021d3c8b9cc100e34d80aa76079",
      "text": "还请，好好守护我们！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000231:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8705611e390009811effb1b7e63de91261ad726ae3dbfebebfbf89417d8f773",
      "text": "我会为你们加油的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000234:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_h:cmd-000236:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267239f4fcaa6caf00fe6025966aca7caf751596855414b5ae4b4bca6e0588d5",
      "text": "啊啊",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c3fb190769036dae47c0b5bed17d9f5d84431908bb24a9f68a72206498f0f9",
      "text": "表演赛当天……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409d6242bc539e2421790c16873231bc889aefa746adf41defc56f2ff0d167e1",
      "text": "红角！活着的传奇兼绝对王者。\n伴随着雷鸣响彻的那个名字是……雷皇！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf19af6f184db062449275901dd66d62141b9d1f479863aaed54396b7998f350",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f202914b5602e81ebdf89ee83fa3fb20095a1c9e83c43ebeea2dd28033462c7d",
      "text": "迎战的蓝角，全员前格斗家！\n转型为偶像的三人组……THE 虎牙道！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5973ac091cbf0538e355ba33ea074a30ccb8397198f55df57f459405baf8507",
      "text": "这场比赛，我们一定要赢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5956b20ab6c3350618258e1e5fd92e2a1e644ced463071b822f913e7a91dd5e",
      "text": "那是当然。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5153821e8fd3eda48a804f196a2c69a81833eb61b6ab88ac4772e7d27038a17b",
      "text": "Ready……FIGHT！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d178459fecc30bffb383ec80e55ae0fce63a8010ad0f44e1b1613957e5f2495f",
      "text": "喝……！哈啊啊啊啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c63cf020d829c991ec9a86021028ceac3e8b49a09d044f53369322914a16c1e2",
      "text": "很漂亮的重拳！但是……太天真了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe239e22046a86adc4fa47bc304335a70979473bdb9f062ad2027222c65bf9ef",
      "text": "唔……！\n竟然躲开我的拳头，打出反击拳？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9305d5e020b6b2bf19939247f6532af554fe60be268f08c502f20f1abc198d7",
      "text": "库哈哈，太逊了吧小不点！\n本大爷可还游刃有余着呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e01a01062d465f50ffa163da448a48267fe74c4872942b5202135c055b6346a4",
      "text": "来啊，尽管攻过来啊！\n还是说你被最强的本大爷吓破胆了？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070832c4b5a27bf8eb34de5870ddeb902d902fc224a12a0f5ba1ef84557e18f1",
      "text": "口气倒是不小，黄毛小儿！\n那么，尝尝这一招怎么样！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffafff5c5d4213c4d3775b6f008c65b7b5c8e8201a986d0a9380c221f98594b9",
      "text": "（好！趁着涟在化解攻击的空隙……\n……唔！？）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6f836d6af58889457212f6fdf9addbee53af0b7cd709d2809691aa8fc0434a",
      "text": "凭这种程度的擒抱就想制住我……可笑！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_i:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6a8d3ff7cdfa2ea3916e04dc50c75b977d9ae25a01f981d848f3125207e417",
      "text": "你们的力量……对JIF倾注的心意，\n说到底不过只有这种程度吗！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba866912b51e6e6385fd4535a7e713fe73a703cd09a9b6efd26552c2ed6bd55f",
      "text": "（我……一定要出战JIF，\n绝对要和他们重逢！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2d4e3990069e441d7825e49cd379f4738ac92b636180c01da74afbd980c613d",
      "text": "（为了住在大楼里的大家，\n我必须赢下来才行！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:286f133198360ef6f78f2bbc499fd9f8073e1d8c0bbed14e903ffa8309461751",
      "text": "（本大爷才是最强的……无论是小不点还是这家伙，\n我都绝不能输！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ff52e9f48c6e8cae1ed278d71663b7733def0c90d33e2405a555bb070d859d1",
      "text": "加油啊，THE 虎牙道——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8f477d2575eaf9887162f7a8ad01229f9abbb75ae05dc3a953f188b59aa876b",
      "text": "……没错，我们怎么可能在\n这种地方停滞不前！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1604ac82b475f13157394eaef650c493db1577c650933df1b8374b35c8032b19",
      "text": "唔……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5fcfadeb93d08995afa6e0fded8d234b341d5db509a7ba724b8073453b8f38",
      "text": "咕……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000205:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f98eaa981c630d0ccfb1a26df8f2458dffc67d0dcd988b5592d43adad92a99",
      "text": "糟了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14926d0e06b510bf515122103745ab3254d6da79a86174204f0e25d84f29642e",
      "text": "上吧，武！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000235:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3135d45417ac312d919378308729eb95602e6bb90bb6fda2bd7f48c9fdecf19",
      "text": "哈啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000243:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfbefc2e06af4d7484d470bd4e6c77d1d7a059ebaf477c2060bb45debb4a03ec",
      "text": "！！\n这一击……挺管用的啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000253:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e2dd38b86cbdb2cf76d70073814eaa35cb738ccf5d79ac26363a2359fc5db6",
      "text": "胜者！THE 虎牙道！！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000270:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b52b436006ffed7840d09aaecc0d21002998e3d54f4b72adfa04e510309d750f",
      "text": "雷皇先生，手给您……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000274:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e6e1792b5de775908cdba0701dfaac046a19b72d013d3820cf69de7ce761c58",
      "text": "抱歉啊……嘿咻。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000289:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2348a25aac305e8550e607432ce066dee7ecc42558fa745fa6734d92081a1644",
      "text": "库哈哈！见识到本大爷的实力了吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000296:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70dfef028d20091b8d12ecb921e60c8061bcc3f7a811c8fbc2ef2f1b5542fa9c",
      "text": "呵……你们作为偶像，\n或许确实还很不成熟。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000301:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4400601065c3d6fa8547a302f5373d095e3bed8fb883c7ee6087e3ef558cab7e",
      "text": "但是……挨了来自偶像如此强劲沉重的拳头，\n我还是第一次经历！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000307:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dac67eb7b6cbf6114c66e653d60cff17c956f59e95d171a477f08c38e969f1b",
      "text": "最重要的是，最后你们的配合让我由衷叹服。\n……很好！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000315:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5efb1425b6495d1738943ff027c9dc5c12767a1d84aef2dbe1e90b21f1b8460d",
      "text": "我来推你们一把！\nTHE 虎牙道……去出战JIF吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000318:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c588cd8672210682a5283ab106c6790d9215979b897e20f7866b76909b7fbe22",
      "text": "喔喔喔喔喔！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_j:cmd-000325:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e9b218d02bd3ec1ca2db196c755e2973660f28af910412bd8b8a5031ac27fa",
      "text": "（赞助商的推荐……！\n这样一来，距离JIF又更近一步了呢！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
